---
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <Meta name="History of lain - YouTube Channel Journey and Content Highlights" description="The full history of lain's YouTube channel, from its humble beginnings to its current state." />
        <Scripts />
        <Cursor />
    </head>

    <body>
        <canvas id="background"></canvas>
        <!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <main>
                <Header />
                <h1>History of lain</h1>

                <p><a href="/version">Also take a look at the website history.</a></p>

                <p>"I", "my" and "me" refers to lain on this page. I use any pronouns as of now.</p>

                <h3>Celeste Content</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>I have started doing Celeste content and now YouTube is nagging me to make more of it.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Adding variety of content - July 2024</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>I started experimenting with new content.</li>
                    <li>So far I am noticing that Celeste content is getting popular on my channel and a beta experiment from YouTube recommended me to upload more Celeste related videos.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Moving to Nekoweb</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>After I created my Codeberg account, I also moved my website from GitHub to Codeberg. When I realized how unstable Codeberg Pages was (over 14 hours of downtime at once!), I moved my site to Nekoweb.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Pronoun Change - December 2023</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>In December 2023, I decided to change my pronouns to she/her, receiving support from most of the servers I was part of.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Starting Learning Japanese - November 2023</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>In November 2023, I started learning Japanese, using Duolingo and other resources such as dictionaries to improve my language skills.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>SEAJAM and Mon Bazou</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>In 2022, I discovered Mon Bazou and created tutorials, guides, and gameplay videos on editing save files and other aspects of the game.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Raspberry Pi Server</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>I acquired a Raspberry Pi and started using it as a server for hosting my projects, including Akabot.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Internet Upgrade</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>I upgraded my internet speed from 10mbps to 100mbps, enabling me to upload videos at a faster rate.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3>Introduction - November 26th, 2019</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>I created my YouTube channel on November 26th, 2019.</li>
                    <li>Initially, I uploaded my previously edited content, which took a few days due to my slow internet connection.</li>
                </ul>

                <p>This summarizes the history of my YouTube channel, highlighting my content, achievements, and personal journey.</p>
            </main>
            <Footer />
        </div>
        <script is:inline defer src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
